---
import ModernFaberSignature from "../components/ModernFaberSignature.astro";
import { inquiryEmailUrl, siteName } from "../lib/site";

const title = "Modern Faber";
const description =
  "A weekly standard for builders. Show up with something real, explain what you changed, do it again.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content={siteName} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16.png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #ffffff;
        --ink: #1a1a1a;
        --muted: #666666;
        --border: #eeeeee;
        --border-strong: #d8d8d8;
        --max-width: 540px;
        --copy-width: 52ch;
        --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        --font-serif: "Instrument Serif", serif;
        --font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        overflow-x: hidden;
        overflow-y: scroll;
        background: var(--bg);
      }

      body {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        line-height: 1.6;
        background: var(--bg);
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      a[href],
      button,
      summary,
      [role="button"],
      [role="link"],
      input[type="button"],
      input[type="submit"],
      input[type="reset"],
      label[for] {
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      strong {
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .page {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.85rem;
      }

      .title {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 4.8rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        line-height: 0.9;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }

      .body {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.35rem;
      }

      .stanza {
        max-width: var(--copy-width);
        font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2vw, 1.08rem);
        line-height: 1.85;
      }

      .manifesto-signature {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding-top: 0.75rem;
      }

      .signature-mark {
        flex: none;
        width: 3.25rem;
        height: 3.25rem;
      }

      .join {
        display: grid;
        justify-items: start;
        padding-top: 1rem;
      }

      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;
        border-radius: 6px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #c0c0c0;
        color: #333333;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease;
      }

      .cta:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #c0c0c0;
      }

      .cta:active {
        transform: translateY(2px);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 #c0c0c0;
      }

      @media (max-width: 720px) {
        body {
          padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
        }

        .title {
          font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 15vw, 4rem);
        }

        .stanza {
          max-width: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <header class="hero">
        <h1 class="title">A Letter to Builders</h1>
      </header>

      <article class="body">
        <p class="stanza">
          Most groups slowly turn into conversation.<br /><br />
          Links get shared. Ideas get circled.<br />
          Nothing gets built.
        </p>

        <p class="stanza">
          Modern Faber exists to interrupt that.<br /><br />
          This is a room where work is normal, deadlines are real, and taste shows up in the
          decisions you made on an actual thing.
        </p>

        <p class="stanza">
          The system is simple.<br /><br />
          Show up every week with something real.<br />
          Explain what you changed.<br />
          Do it again.
        </p>

        <p class="stanza">
          Miss twice and you are out.<br /><br />
          No exceptions, because one exception becomes the precedent.
        </p>

        <p class="stanza">
          There is no audience here. Only other builders paying attention &mdash; to your choices,
          your revisions, the details other people skip.
        </p>

        <p class="stanza">
          That costs something. It should.<br /><br />
          The upside is a body of work, a sharper eye, and the people you actually want beside
          you.
        </p>

        <p class="stanza">
          If this sounds obvious, you are close.<br />
          If it sounds heavy, this is not your room.
        </p>

        <footer class="manifesto-signature" aria-label="Signed Modern Faber">
          <img class="signature-mark" src="/images/dither.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
          <ModernFaberSignature />
        </footer>
      </article>

      <section class="join" aria-label="Join Modern Faber">
        <a class="cta" href={inquiryEmailUrl}>Become a Modern Faber</a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
